{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0613_1000_038chz", "source_sha256": "fe176424fedf5a7ae38e283f58466b08b01047cb7faca81ac0f2d058751f4f92", "ja": "{$P$}……！\nその、チョコレートの方はもう召し上がりまして？", "zh": "{$P$}……！\n那个，巧克力您已经吃过了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0613_1001_p", "source_sha256": "213100120ea0a35803bbda284ae94946cef5c8ab5aa0891377b4ae12d3238c73", "ja": "チョコ？　あ、先日千鶴さんがくれた……。\nはい、美味しかったですよ！", "zh": "巧克力？啊，就是前几天千鹤小姐送我的那份……  \n嗯，很好吃哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0613_1002_038chz", "source_sha256": "81d7fa7450427e13ee6f7913c8d1fe359f0c8afc90093ef3f012b92db166a039", "ja": "ああ、やっぱりそうですわよね……！\nじゃあ、あのメッセージの方も……。", "zh": "啊，果然是这样呢……！\n那么，那条留言也是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0613_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d8dff2b5606859ff518047fb94c1943cbfd35a36e0fe94aaeff76bd4a825f61d", "ja": "はい、もちろん。\nチョコの上に書いてあった、大きな文字で……。", "zh": "是的，当然。\n写在巧克力上的那几个大字……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0613_1004_038chz", "source_sha256": "56b22c79c1eb874c827167afd3cccbc0d35de933b2c60fba2273eb25adca8ce4", "ja": "……！　ち、違うんですの！　あの文字は、\nあくまで形式的なものといいますか……！", "zh": "……！不、不是那样的！那些字，\n该说是纯粹出于礼节吗……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0613_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "a6d49dc906881361f8eccaddcd58fc0e6293586528ed3709dfb2ef40f5da4727", "ja": "バレンタインチョコと言えば、の文字ですから！\n……ま、まあ、多少は……その……。", "zh": "说到情人节巧克力，当然就得写上那个字嘛！\n……嗯、嗯，多少还是有点……那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0613_1006_p", "source_sha256": "9a7daa1b577f1858f57a08d8677c1b740217c076c6e40199c73dc3357eb07f14", "ja": "大丈夫です、千鶴さん。\n王道をよく押さえたチョコだなと感心しました。", "zh": "没事的，千鹤。\n我很佩服你这巧克力充分把握住了经典要素。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0613_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "0ebdc45e4b29d05b87a655775d69c1bca41570a212b427bf357fe7173f9d8e63", "ja": "……。そ、その通りです！　ふぅ、よかったですわ。\nご迷惑をおかけしたのではないかと……。", "zh": "……。就、就是这样！呼，太好了。\n我还以为给您添麻烦了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0613_1008_038chz", "source_sha256": "96439b30f4c3be017ac54892b03d45d689d9ad8c6133f3fce9bc44a4bcfbc4aa", "ja": "コホン！　いえ、思ったより上手く作れたので\nちょっと調子に乗ってしまいましたわ。", "zh": "咳咳！不是，只是因为做得比想象中顺利，\n所以有点得意忘形了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0613_1009_p", "source_sha256": "27f735c8546eb77e8cf7df310b8570446ae814e706ee8e3c092bf03eacc15bc3", "ja": "そうだったんですね。\nということは、もしかして一人で……？", "zh": "原来是这样啊。\n也就是说，难道是一个人……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0613_1010_038chz", "source_sha256": "54dedd9a07ab1bfbab6cae38f2357250c2bf127276b3b4e68d7cc66d4bbab542", "ja": "はい。本当はお母さ……ではなく！\nシェフに手伝ってもらおうか、悩みましたけど……。", "zh": "是的。其实本来想请母亲……不对！\n我还在纠结要不要请厨师帮忙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0613_1011_038chz", "source_sha256": "01d80d6a6971f94c63bb701e761a94c6f66a4c3e75f153caae3879417d2d02ae", "ja": "わたくしの気持ちを伝えるものですから、\n自分の手で作った方がよいかと思いまして。", "zh": "因为这是要传达我的心意，\n所以我觉得还是亲手制作比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0613_1012_038chz", "source_sha256": "9b899321c413b1bd9edfc40d02b3e1cd36bb6373878c428a1b336df29d0c1727", "ja": "き、気持ちと言っても、感謝の気持ちですわよ！\n{$P$}への感謝を込めましたの！", "zh": "即、即便说是心意，也是感谢之情哦！\n这里面倾注了我对{$P$}的感谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0613_1013_p", "source_sha256": "5dda0ed5c51698c76300b430a10f536144b03a926e2021783d1d9ce7627234b4", "ja": "千鶴さん……ありがとうございます！\nしっかりと伝わりましたよ、その気持ち。", "zh": "千鹤……谢谢你！\n你的这份心意，我确实感受到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0613_1014_038chz", "source_sha256": "cf181c7b61643620bb08eb4ecd90788e203a11337545dc7092f09bc8fa2b2147", "ja": "うふふ、嬉しいですわ♪　では、次は\nもっとゴージャスなチョコをプレゼントいたしますわ！", "zh": "呵呵呵，真是太高兴了♪那么，下次\n我会为您奉上更加豪华的巧克力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0613_1015_038chz", "source_sha256": "325837369b9c525c06b657bc131f8ea301a00cfc68f6411723553a158c20caa7", "ja": "期待しててくださいまし、{$P$}！\nおーっほっほっほ、ゲホッゴホッ！", "zh": "请期待哦，{$P$}！\n哦呵呵呵呵，咳咳咳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
